   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🧩Paso 3: Limpieza básica de datos\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 Corregir sentinels y fechas imposibles\n",
    "**🎯 Objetivo:**  \n",
    "Aplicar reglas de limpieza para reemplazar valores sentinels y corregir fechas imposibles.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Instrucciones:**  \n",
    "- En `age`, reemplaza el sentinel **-999** con la mediana.\n",
    "- En `city`, reemplaza el sentinel `\"?\"` por valores nulos (`pd.NA`).  \n",
    "- Marca como nulas (`pd.NA`) las fechas fuera de rango."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "73891874",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "count    4000.000000\n",
       "mean       48.136000\n",
       "std        17.689919\n",
       "min        18.000000\n",
       "25%        33.000000\n",
       "50%        48.000000\n",
       "75%        63.000000\n",
       "max        79.000000\n",
       "Name: age, dtype: float64"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 20,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "# Reemplazar -999 por la mediana de age\n",
    "age_mediana = users[users['age'] != -999 ]['age'].median()\n",
    "users['age'] = users['age'].replace(-999, age_mediana)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# Verificar cambios\n",
    "users['age'].describe()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "id": "2fe9e5f9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
